            <title><![CDATA[Microsoft offers mass buyouts for roughly a quarter of its workforce (917 pts)]]></title>
            <link>https://www.seattletimes.com/business/microsoft/microsoft-offers-mass-buyouts-for-roughly-a-quarter-of-its-workforce/</link>
